<view class="page"><view class="heading">{{role==='seller'?'售卖订单':'我的购买'}}</view><view class="sub">在这里跟进付款、交付和售后。</view><view wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="id" class="card order-card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="go"><view class="row"><text class="time">{{item.time}}</text><text class="tag">{{item.label}}</text></view><view class="item"><image class="cover" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="item-content"><view class="title">{{item.snapshot.title}}</view><view class="price">¥{{item.yuan}}</view></view><text class="sub">›</text></view></view><view wx:if="!orders.length&&!loading" class="empty">还没有订单<text>
</text>找到合适教材后，交易记录会出现在这里</view><view wx:if="loading" class="loading">加载订单中…</view></view>
